  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Netherlands-Vietnam Business Event on Green Innovation &amp; Circular Economy Partnerships</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Netherlands-Vietnam Business Event on Green Innovation &amp; Circular Economy Partnerships was held in The Hague on 2 October 2025, as part of a broader Vietnamese trade mission on circular economy and sustainable production.The event aimed to:1.	Strengthen Vietnamese government commitment to develop enabling regulations for eco-design and wastewater treatment and2.	Foster knowledge exchange, matchmaking, and technology partnerships between Dutch and Vietnamese companies in plastics, textiles, wastewater, and solid waste management.The programme featured a panel discussion moderated by Holland Circular Hotspot, a technology showcase by NX Filtration, matchmaking sessions per cluster, and a networking reception.</narrative>
  </description>
